            "description": "<p>From large-scale production facilities to specialized niche operations, EZG Manufacturing serves businesses across the food processing spectrum. Our equipment supports applications such as:</p><ul><li>Meat and poultry processing</li><li>Dairy and beverage industry operations</li><li>Bakery and snack food manufacturing</li><li>Packaged goods and consumer-ready food production</li><li>Fermentation process systems</li><li>Pet food production</li></ul><p>Whether you're handling raw materials or contributing a component part to a larger system, we help support the entire process, from start to final product.</p>",
